  "termsHeaderUpdatedPre": "Something changed",
  "termsUpdatedNotice": "We updated these terms because Nexo now includes the Students section, which uses its own server and may show other people's data. Please read them again before continuing.",
  "termsItemDirectoryTitle": "The Students section",
  "termsItemDirectoryBody": "It is a directory only authorized accounts can enter, and it shows up in the app only if yours is one of them. To check that, your username and password travel once to the Nexo server, which verifies them against SIGMA and does not store them; from then on a temporary session is used. Every time you open a student record, your code, the date and whose record you opened are logged.",
  "termsItemThirdPartyTitle": "Other people's data",
  "termsItemThirdPartyBody": "If you have directory access you will be seeing other people's information. Use it only for what you were authorized to: do not download, copy, share or publish it. Peru's Personal Data Protection Act (Law 29733) applies to you too, and access can be revoked at any time.",
  "termsItemDemoDataTitle": "Demo data",
  "termsItemDemoDataBody": "Until there is institutional authorization to query the real directory, the Students section shows generated test data: people who do not exist. When it is replaced with real data we will update these terms and ask you to accept them again.",
  "termsItemMicrosoftTitle": "Microsoft account (optional)",
  "termsItemMicrosoftBody": "If you connect your institutional Microsoft account, Nexo reads your Teams classes and assignments to show them in the app. The connection is optional, you authorize it yourself in the browser, and you can disconnect it whenever you want.",
  "termsItemDeviceTitle": "What stays on your device",
  "termsItemDeviceBody": "Nexo keeps a local copy of your schedule, grades and payments so it works offline, and schedules notifications and widgets on the device itself. All of it is wiped when you sign out.",
  "termsItemChangesTitle": "Changes to these terms",
  "termsItemChangesBody": "If something important changes in how your data is handled, we will update these terms and show them to you again before you keep using the app. You can reread them any time from Profile, under Terms & Privacy.",
